// Session services. All of these come from Nix (hh-nix-config,
// modules/desktop.nix and modules/theme.nix), except swaylock (pacman: it
// needs the system PAM stack).
// quickshell, awww-daemon, wallpaper-watch and swayidle are systemd user
// services (modules/services.nix): supervised, restarted on crash.
// Restart the shell with `systemctl --user restart quickshell`.
